OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FChance of
OL,6,Fthe odd shower at first but otherwise
OL,7,Fit will stay dry through this evening
OL,8,Fand overnight with some sunny then
OL,9,Fclear spells and turning quite chilly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FDry in the morning with sunny
OL,12,Fspells. A mostly dry afternoon with
OL,13,Fstill plenty of bright spells, but
OL,14,Fmore by the way of cloud and the odd
OL,15,Flight shower possible.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FAn
OL,18,Funsettled and changeable period with
OL,19,Fthe risk of rain or showers, the rain
OL,20,Fpossibly heavy at times but feeling
OL,21,Fwarm in any sunshine.
